            "question": "Will my phone fit inside the bag?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The bag easily accommodates all modern smartphones up to the iPhone 15 Pro Max and Samsung Galaxy Ultra series, even when enclosed in a protective case, alongside a bifold wallet and keys.</p>"
